  "description": "The Kinesis Range 50 Flat Bar e-bike is an elegant electric fitness bike that makes light work of hills and allows you to travel faster, further and more frequently than ever before. It features a lightweight aluminium frame paired with the excellent Fazua Ride 50 Trail motor system, for a carefree and enjoyable experience on every journey.The Fazua Ride50 motor system kicks in below 15.5mph, providing you with up to 350 Watts of assistance, offering you a welcome helping hand when moving off from a standstill, or taking on hills. Above 15.5mph, the Fazua motor seamlessly decouples from the drivetrain, so you can push on without any extra resistance. With three customisable levels of assistance and an integrated top tube remote, you remain in complete control of the level of power that you need. Need to go further? Spare batteries are available and easy to change, so you can carry as much battery as you need.The Range is also equipped with ten-speed MicroSHIFT XLE gears and Tektro hydraulic brakes, for smooth faultless shifting and powerful controlled braking. The inclusion of high-volume all-terrain tyres means that this e-bike is perfectly equipped for journeys off-road, whether it’s a canal path or a trip into the woods.Regardless of whether you ride for fun, fitness or exploration, The Range is a rewarding ride that is the perfect complement to a modern lifestyle. Empower your riding and go further with the Range fitness E-bike.",
